# Check text out with LF on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true gets CRLF files, and
# Prettier (endOfLine: lf) reports every one of them as unformatted, so
# `npm run check` fails on a pristine checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch their bytes.
*.db     binary
*.png    binary
*.webp   binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.ico    binary
*.mp4    binary
*.woff   binary
*.woff2  binary
*.docx   binary
*.pdf    binary
